            "explanation": "The reference explicitly warns against entering an area chiefly for money or an external measure of success rather than passion. No returned passage or provided context includes that part of the warning. The answer recommends passion but does not clearly identify money or external success as the mistake; its focus on a merely useful product comes from a separate point about user excitement."
          },
